/- The actual inverse native chart is a local Riemannian isometry
on every open ambient cap lying on the interior side of its target.
The source model is self and the target model is the original
half-space; their tangent metrics are not identified by fiat. -/
open Bundle Set TauCeti TauCeti.Manifold
open scoped Manifold Topology ContDiff
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency false
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 100000
namespace ConformalPoisson
variable {n : ℕ} {M : Type*} [TopologicalSpace M]
