/- Shared H2 coefficient readings for the actual ambient metric,
and the actual square-root-density exponential weight. The compact
cap supplies boundedness; no coordinate or volume compatibility is
postulated. The native chart readback supplies that compatibility. -/
open Bundle Set MeasureTheory TopologicalSpace TauCeti TauCeti.Manifold InnerProductSpace
open scoped Manifold ContDiff Topology ENNReal
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency false
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 100000
namespace ConformalPoisson
variable {d : ℕ} (D : Opens (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin d)))
