/- The exact Riemannian Carleman commutator for a compactly supported
smooth test. All three integration steps are proved in the imported
chain, for the same weight, test function, metric and volume. -/
open Bundle FiberBundle Set MeasureTheory TauCeti TauCeti.Manifold
open scoped Manifold ContDiff InnerProductSpace
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency false
namespace ConformalPoisson
variable {E : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup E] [NormedSpace ℝ E] [FiniteDimensional ℝ E]
  {H : Type*} [TopologicalSpace H] {I : ModelWithCorners ℝ E H} [I.Boundaryless]
