noncomputable section ProofPart_LocalZeroTraceExtension



/- A local zero trace gives a genuine H1 zero extension across the
physical boundary on a smaller ambient open set. The cutoff avoids
imposing a trace condition on the artificial edge. -/
open Set MeasureTheory TopologicalSpace Filter TauCeti
open scoped ContDiff ENNReal
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency false
namespace ConformalPoisson
variable {E : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup E] [InnerProductSpace ℝ E]
