/-
Higher Sobolev forcing for the principal equation with coefficients
smooth on the relative chart target. Adapted from the pinned Tau Ceti
`PDE.exists_wkp_forcing_energyFormH1_principal_eq_of_contDiffOn` in
`Regularity/HigherOrder.lean`. Original copyright (c)2026 The Tau Ceti
contributors, Apache2.0; see External/LICENSE.tauceti. The relative
multiplier replaces the ambient-open coefficient assumption.
