noncomputable section ProofPart_RelativeDifferentiatedEquation



/-
The differentiated weak equation with relative smooth coefficients.
Adapted from pinned Tau Ceti `Regularity/HigherOrder.lean`, theorem
`exists_hasWeakLineDerivOn_and_energyFormH1_eq_setIntegral_of_contDiffOn`.
Original copyright (c)2026 The Tau Ceti contributors; Apache2.0,
see External/LICENSE.tauceti. Derivative fields within the relative
target supply the Sobolev commutator terms, and are identified with
ordinary coefficient derivatives only inside the actual open cap.
