/- The full frozen smooth Schauder input follows from the actual
bounded ball Laplacian inverse. The inverse is an OPEN producer
obligation here, not an added literature premise of the selected root. -/
open Set Metric
open scoped NNReal ContDiff
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency false
namespace ConformalPoisson.DirichletHolder
variable {d : ℕ} {α : ℝ≥0}
