/- A pointwise forcing error of order r^alpha supplies the precise
local L2 residual required by the Campanato theorem. The reference can
have a tangential jump; its zero divergence is an actual hypothesis
about the chosen field, proved by TransmissionReference for constants
with matching normal components. -/
