/- An actual H1 weak directional derivative of a C2 representative
has the expected classical value and gradient. These identities link
the H2 tangential extension producer to the classical Hessian caller. -/
open Set Metric Filter MeasureTheory TopologicalSpace TauCeti TauCeti.PDE InnerProductSpace
open scoped NNReal InnerProductSpace Gradient ContDiff
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency false
namespace ConformalPoisson
variable {n : ℕ} {μ : Measure (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin (n + 1)))} [μ.IsAddHaarMeasure]
