Released under Apache 2.0 license as described in External/LICENSE.tauceti.
Authors: The Tau Ceti contributors

The six inversion geometry lemmas below are adopted from private
helpers in TauCeti/Geometry/Manifold/Instances/ClosedBall/Basic.lean at
revision 4d91513e4d30746eb1fa96658c18e051c772e55e. Their proof bodies
are unchanged. They are exposed in a project namespace and the dimension
is n+1, so its positive-dimension instance is automatic. The original
pinned source is retained unchanged.
