    (w : Wkp μ V p 2)
    (hw : Wkp.value 2 w =ᵐ[μ.restrict V] (Ω : Set E).indicator (Wkp.value 2 u)) :
    ‖w‖ ≤ ‖Wkp.value 2 u‖ + ‖Wkp.iteratedGradient 0 (Wkp.lowerOrder 1 u)‖ +
