/- Density of actual smooth native forcings in finite Lp. This makes the
inverse evaluation extensions and their representing rows unique. -/
open Bundle Set MeasureTheory TauCeti Metric
open scoped Manifold ContDiff ENNReal NNReal
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency true
namespace ConformalPoisson
variable {n : ℕ} {M : Type*} [TopologicalSpace M] [T2Space M]
