/- Actual value and outward-normal rows on the original manifold. The value
row is classical away from its pole in the interior; the normal row is
classical throughout the interior. No claim of boundary regularity is made. -/
open Bundle Set MeasureTheory TauCeti Filter Metric TopologicalSpace
open scoped Manifold ContDiff Topology ENNReal
namespace ConformalPoisson
variable {n : ℕ} {M : Type*} [TopologicalSpace M] [T2Space M]
