/- Zero extension of an actual compact native chart flux. It is smooth
within the closed model half-space, including its physical face; only the
artificial chart boundary is removed by compact support. -/
open Bundle Module MeasureTheory Set Filter TauCeti TauCeti.Manifold
open scoped Manifold ContDiff Topology
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency false
namespace ConformalPoisson
variable {n : ℕ} {M : Type*} [TopologicalSpace M] [T2Space M]
