/- A fixed-inner local gradient bound from the proved homogeneous
Hessian estimate. The constant is fixed before all Sobolev functions. -/
open MeasureTheory Set TopologicalSpace Filter TauCeti Module Metric
open scoped ENNReal NNReal InnerProductSpace ContDiff Gradient
namespace ConformalPoisson
variable {E : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup E] [InnerProductSpace ℝ E]
  [FiniteDimensional ℝ E] [MeasurableSpace E] [BorelSpace E]
