            (⟨ball (extChartAt Ihalf c c) (r / 8), isOpen_ball⟩ : Opens V)) 2 (k + 2),
        ∀ u, Wkp.value (k + 2) (T u) =ᵐ[(Module.finBasis ℝ V).addHaar.restrict
