/- The exact native surface Poisson representation of the SAME Green
kernel. Smooth boundary data are extended to zero near the interior pole;
the row pole is removed strictly inside that zero neighborhood. Actual
Green's identity and actual forcing representation then give the formula. -/
open Bundle Set Filter MeasureTheory TauCeti
open scoped Manifold ContDiff Topology ENNReal
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency false
namespace ConformalPoisson
variable {n : ℕ} {M : Type*} [TopologicalSpace M] [T2Space M]
