    B.crossTaylor_profile hU M (2 * k) hP hD hy,
    B.phaseTaylor_profile, B.tangentSecondTaylor_profile hU M (2 * k) hP hD hy,
    B.tangentFirstTaylor_profile hU M (2 * k) hP hD hy,
    B.principalTerm_zero_profile P hy]
